 source fingerprint. [The expansion review](research/extension-review.md)
 records independent semantic and fresh-archive checks at each checkpoint.
 
+## Finite code-point preprocessing
+
+`CodePointInput` admits surrogate code points before producing scalar output.
+Its independent relation, normalization laws and refinement preserve the existing
+`CssInput` scalar API. See the [domain and source contract](research/codepoint-input.md).
+This adds no byte decoder or WebIDL/UTF-16 conversion. The full checker includes
+its proofs and 21 examples; `python3 check.py --coverage-only` checks static
+coverage/audit registrations without running Lean.
+
